374
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:24,080
That took a lot of courage.

375
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,440
Thanks.

376
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,480
She complimented him.

377
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,840
Zhao Xilun is getting shy again.

378
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,800
That's the Courageous' flower?

379
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,640
It's a flower for you.

380
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:39,860
(A flower for you)

381
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,880
They're finally getting somewhere.

382
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,000
It's a flower for you.

383
00:13:46,060 --> 00:13:47,960
(A flower for you)

384
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,840
That was such a smooth line.

385
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,640
Anyway, thanks for yesterday.

386
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,560
I had a great time.

387
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:01,980
(Happy)

388
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,800
Wait, let me fix this.

389
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,120
(Panicking)
I wasn't this slow before.

390
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:07,640
You know.

391
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:08,120
Maybe I...

392
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:10,560
Maybe

393
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:11,720
I was so busy talking to you

394
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,280
that I wasn't really
paying attention to this.

395
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,120
Do you want to give it a squeeze?

396
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,200
It's done.

397
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:22,840
It's fixed.

398
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,000
You're really good at this.

399
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,600
You're really good.

400
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:27,880
He's happy.

401
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,280
What now?

402
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,800
What else can we do?

403
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,280
He's flustered.

404
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:39,680
What should we do?

405
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:40,600
Add something to it.

406
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,480
Right.

407
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,880
I was just... yeah.

408
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,760
No.

409
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,560
What's wrong with you?

410
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:55,040
I don't know.

411
00:14:55,740 --> 00:14:57,340
(Thud)

412
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:03,120
I feel like today

413
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,280
feels a little different.

414
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:06,640
There's kind of a romantic vibe.

415
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,760
We're pretty funny together.

416
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,000
We're really something.

417
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:14,840
What should we eat later?

418
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,560
Actually...

419
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,440
Do you have plans?

420
00:15:24,910 --> 00:15:26,720
I actually wanted
to prepare a surprise for you,

421
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,680
