422
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,320
Maybe next time.

423
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:33,120
Why?

424
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:35,200
(Pinch)
He has another date.

425
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,640
On the same day.

426
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,920
So we're skipping dinner?

427
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,560
Sha Yue'er is still looking forward
to what's next.

428
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:48,520
Maybe.

429
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,040
Yeah.

430
00:15:49,040 --> 00:15:49,920
But

431
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,320
