432
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:51,920
I'll make you something good.

433
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,440
So what are we having today?

434
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,160
Well...

435
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:58,880
We'll have some cake later.

436
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:00,040
Let's have some cake first.

437
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:01,960
This is for you.

438
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:04,200
Thanks.

439
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,140
(Spots the cherry)

440
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,680
What's your favorite fruit?

441
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,080
Cherries.

442
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:11,160
Oh, cherries.

443
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:12,360
There's a cherry on top.

444
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,640
Yeah, there's a cherry on top.

445
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,480
And a blueberry.

446
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:18,240
You can just take the cherry.

447
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:18,480
Yeah.

448
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,860
(Gives the cherry to Sha Yue'er)

449
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,000
It's pretty good.

450
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,040
You picked a good one.

451
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:28,620
(Approved)

452
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,920
Our schedule

453
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,480
