454
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,840
I didn't get to take you somewhere nice.

455
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,480
It's okay.

456
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,460
But next time, for sure.

457
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,480
(Next time, for sure)

458
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:42,940
Okay.

459
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:44,220
(Okay)

460
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:54,300
(Can't get enough)

461
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:54,880
You could tell

462
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:56,040
from Zhao Xilun's date

463
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:57,600
with Sha Yue'er

464
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:59,600
that they were really
comfortable together.

465
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,080
Yeah.

466
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,440
It's just a little disappointing

467
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,840
