468
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,360
and didn't even get to have a meal.

469
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:05,360
(Zhao Xilun)
He started squeezing the slime

470
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:06,920
in his hand like crazy.

471
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,360
But he did prepare some cake.

472
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:09,720
And he even thought

473
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,040
