474
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:12,320
might not be good for her.

475
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:13,000
And he also got something

476
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:13,720
with anti-inflammatory benefits,

477
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,000
something that's good for health.

478
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,840
He was so thoughtful.

479
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:17,480
(Zhao Xilun being thoughtful)
Cute.

480
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,400
But actually, in the end,

481
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,800
he was pretty subtle about it.

482
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,000
But I think they both

483
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:21,600
understood

484
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:22,440
that he had

485
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,840
another date today.

486
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:24,520
I think it was important

487
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,480
that he made that clear.

488
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,360
Whenever they're together,

489
00:17:27,360 --> 00:17:28,040
