490
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,560
are always pretty easy.

491
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:30,560
They click.

492
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:33,680
(Sha Yue'er & Zhao Xilun click)
They talk about similar things too.

493
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:35,440
This kind of meaningful conversation

494
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,800
can quickly bring two people closer,

495
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:37,640
whether it's emotionally,

496
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,050
(Good talks bring people closer)
in terms of their values,

497
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,000
how well they work together,

498
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,960
or how well

499
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,640
they understand each other.

500
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,080
There's another thing.

501
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,880
No matter what happens,

502
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:45,560
I always find a way

503
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:46,960
to be there for you.

504
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,000
(Being there for each other)
As for that,

505
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,120
(Deepening their connection)
there's something I remember

506
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:50,280
