507
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,960
Sha Yue'er said about Zhao Xilun,

508
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,760
"Your courage moved me."

509
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:54,880
That word, "courage",

510
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:55,720
was something

511
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,120
Sha Yue'er really noticed in him,

512
00:17:57,360 --> 00:17:58,960
and it also inspired her.

513
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,400
That feeling

514
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,120
is really beautiful.

515
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:02,520
You can see

516
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:03,920
that their feelings

517
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:04,640
are still growing.

518
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,040
Yeah.

519
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,080
Not bad.

520
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:07,520
Alright,

521
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:09,120
