523
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:25,560
Sun Qimeng.

524
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:31,160
A completely different style.

525
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,960
This look really suits her.

526
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:33,840
She looks so good.

527
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:41,840
Here he comes.

528
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,200
Hello.

529
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,400
Hello.

530
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:03,080
Hello.

531
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,840
This place is really beautiful.

532
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,480
It's gorgeous.

533
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:09,560
Even the sun looks better now
than it did earlier.

534
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:11,280
You came at the perfect time.

535
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,840
The setting is really nice.

536
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:14,520
So thoughtful.

537
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:15,120
Thanks.

538
00:19:17,250 --> 00:19:18,560
