539
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:19,620
(Throat lozenges she prepared)

540
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:21,920
Thank you.

541
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,730
(Receives it with both hands)
Thank you.

542
00:19:24,730 --> 00:19:26,920
They're really going step for step.

543
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,680
Whatever he just did for Sha Yue'er,

544
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,900
Sun Qimeng is doing the same for him.

545
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:31,660
(Spelled it out perfectly)

546
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:32,840
You bought her a cake,

547
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:33,920
