548
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:34,800
Right.

549
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:37,420
(Receives it with both hands)
Thank you.

550
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,400
You can take a look.

551
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:41,880
You actually bought these for me?

552
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,040
Yeah.

553
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:44,640
I really appreciate it.

554
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,680
Thank you so much.

555
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:47,920
Because my throat

556
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,040
