561
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:01,020
(Lowers his head)

562
00:20:01,020 --> 00:20:02,360
He didn't know what to do.

563
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:03,720
Sorry.

564
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:04,920
I was

565
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,840
