566
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:07,800
Don't worry about it.

567
00:20:07,850 --> 00:20:08,670
Relax.

568
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,320
I ordered some soup for you.

569
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:11,820
(Soup specially ordered for him)

570
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:13,880
You're

571
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,760
so thoughtful.

572
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,280
Did you ever think

573
00:20:19,280 --> 00:20:19,920
I might

574
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,240
be the one to ask you out?

575
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,960
I was actually pretty surprised.

576
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,600
Surprised?

577
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:31,960
Yeah. It's just that,

578
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,000
in my mind,

579
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:33,880
I feel like

580
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:34,400
girls are usually

581
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:36,040
a little slower

582
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:37,480
