586
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,840
I think courageous people
are really attractive.

587
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:46,840
So I honestly didn't expect

588
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,600
to receive this.

589
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:49,600
Thank you.

590
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,440
I guess it's...

591
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:53,400
Yeah.

592
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:55,240
I really was touched.

593
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,480
And this place

594
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,680
